                                "sense_id": "53af67cf-6ff4-3deb-91ad-e796c5662a6f",
                                "text": "1905, Bram Stoker, The Man Chapter I\nhis thoughts went womanward and wifeward"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb0e6b0b-9011-4f4e-b486-3a79a1dcb61f",
                                "sense_id": "53af67cf-6ff4-3deb-91ad-e796c5662a6f",
                                "text": "Then Belial Machiavelli saw\n⁠Her error and, I trust, his own,\nWired to the minion of the Law,\n⁠And travelled wifeward—not alone:\nFor Lilly—thirteen-two and bay—\nCame in a horse-box all the way."
                            }
